 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 9 – 11, use the following passage:</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>A doctor sees between 7 and 12 patients each day. On Mondays and Tuesdays, the appointment times are 15 minutes. On Wednesdays and Thursdays, they are 30 minutes long. On Fridays, they are one hour long. The doctor works for no more than 8 hours a day. Here are some inequalities that represent this situation.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.25\\;\\leq\\;y\\;\\leq\\;1\">0.25\\;\\leq\\;y\\;\\leq\\;1</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span data-math=\"7\\;\\leq\\;x\\;\\leq\\;12\">7\\;\\leq\\;x\\;\\leq\\;12</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span data-math=\"xy\\;\\leq\\;8\">xy\\;\\leq\\;8</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n <br>",
